.SH EXTENSIONS
The functions marked as extensions originated in
.IR \%ncurses ","
and are not found in SVr4
.IR curses ","
4.4BSD
.IR curses ","
or any other previous
.I curses
implementation.
.PP
.I \%ncurses
allows
.I opts
to be a pointer to
.IR int ","
which overrides the
.I pair
.RI ( short )
argument.
